OL,3,AArchers fans urged to back fight to
OL,4,Akeep show in city
OL,5,
OL,6,FCast members will be chatting to fans
OL,7,Foutside The Archers: Live at 75
OL,8,Froadshows in Coventry and Wolverhampton
OL,9,Fto ask them to lobby the BBC and their
OL,10,FMPs.
OL,12,FThe broadcaster said it was having
OL,13,F"constructive discussions with
OL,14,Fprogramme makers and local
OL,15,Fstakeholders," and remains committed to
OL,16,Ffinding a long-term solution.
